{"id":"17E","title":"Patience","part":{"n":17,"title":"Personal character traits"},"url":"/law/17-personal-character-traits/17e","entries":[{"id":"17E.1","text":"Patience, long-suffering and temperance exhorted and commended.","refs":[{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":7,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":4,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":1,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"12"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":5,"verses":"14"},{"book":"2 Timothy","chapter":3,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Titus","chapter":2,"verses":"2"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":2,"verses":"2-3"}],"citation":"Eccl. 7:8; Eph. 4:2; Col. 1:11; Col. 3:12; 1 Thes. 5:14; 2 Tim. 3:10; Titus 2:2; 1 Pet. 1: 6; Rev. 2:2-3."},{"id":"17E.2","text":"Rashness and quick-temperedness exalts folly.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":14,"verses":"29"}],"citation":"Prov. 14:29."},{"id":"17E.3","text":"Trials of Christians leads to patience.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":5,"verses":"3-4"},{"book":"James","chapter":1,"verses":"3-4"}],"citation":"Rom. 5:3-4; James 1:3-4."},{"id":"17E.4","text":"When you do what is right and suffer for it, if you patiently endure it, this is commendable before God.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":2,"verses":"20"}],"citation":"1 Pet. 2:20."},{"id":"17E.5","text":"Be not rash with what you speak and do.","refs":[{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":5,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":19,"verses":"36"}],"citation":"Eccl. 5:2; Acts 19:36."},{"id":"17E.6","text":"Patience is to be exercised in running the race set before us.","refs":[{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":12,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Heb. 12: 1."},{"id":"17E.7","text":"We are to be patient in tribulation.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:12."},{"id":"17E.8","text":"Christian faith and hope for the salvation of God and the coming of the Lord requires patience.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":37,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":40,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Lamentations","chapter":3,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":8,"verses":"25"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":1,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"5"},{"book":"2 Thessalonians","chapter":3,"verses":"5"},{"book":"James","chapter":5,"verses":"7-8"}],"citation":"Psa. 37:7; Psa. 40:1; Lam. 3:26; Rom. 8:25; 1 Cor. 1:7; Gal. 5:5; 2 Thes. 3:5; James 5:7-8."},{"id":"17E.9","text":"We are to pursue patience.","refs":[{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":6,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"1 Tim. 6:11."},{"id":"17E.10","text":"A servant of Christ is to be patient.","refs":[{"book":"2 Timothy","chapter":2,"verses":"24"}],"citation":"2 Tim. 2:24."},{"id":"17E.11","text":"The test of your faith produces patience.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":1,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"James 1:3."}]}